<title>USA: Nu-Kote sees Q3 Dec. 31 operating loss.</title>
<headline>Nu-Kote sees Q3 Dec. 31 operating loss.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nu-Kote Holding Inc said on Friday sales of its printing ribbons and other products have declined faster than expected, and it expects to report an operating loss for the third quarter ended December 31.</p>
<p>The company said third-quarter revenues will be lower than the previous two quarters. Actual results will be announced next week.</p>
</text>
